{"n": 1052, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1052.webp", "text": "5210000 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nFRONT SEAT\n\nPush back seat.\nPull off caps.\nUnscrew nuts (1).\n\nPush seat forward..\nPull off caps.\nUnscrew nut and bolt.\n\n4 Doors:\n\nPull off cap.\nUnscrew seat belt.\nInstallation:\nTightening torque*,\n\n* See Specifications\n\n521100\n\n52 1100\n\n30 52034\n\n5210100 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nOR REPLACING SEAT RAIL\n(OUTER OR INNER) ON LEFT\nOR RIGHT FRONT SEAT\n\nRemove front seat — see 52 10 000.\nUnscrew bolt.\n\nCompress springs and pull out pin.\nInstallation:\n\nTightening torque*.\n\nAlways replace pin,\n\nSaxionia Pin Shown Removed:\n\nGuide in tongue of Special Tool 52 1 100\n\n— arrest (1) is deactivated — add drive out pin.\nInstallation:\n\nAlways replace pin.\n\nDrive in pin against stop with the special tool\nmandrel.\n\nCheck whether arrest (1) has engaged and\nstops (2) are not damaged.\n\nDisconnect linkage rod.\nLift connecting tube out of square hole in\ncontrol lever with a screwdriver,\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["5210000", 0.2644, 0.0723, 0.3141, 0.0836], ["REMOVING", 0.3273, 0.0723, 0.387, 0.0836], ["AND", 0.3906, 0.0729, 0.4144, 0.0836], ["INSTALLING", 0.4184, 0.0729, 0.4858, 0.0836], ["FRONT", 0.3273, 0.0882, 0.3647, 0.1001], ["SEAT", 0.3678, 0.0882, 0.3961, 0.1001], ["Push", 0.2649, 0.1207, 0.2872, 0.132], ["back", 0.2903, 0.1214, 0.3126, 0.132], ["seat.", 0.3166, 0.1227, 0.3374, 0.132], ["Pull", 0.2649, 0.1366, 0.2827, 0.1479], ["off", 0.2862, 0.1366, 0.3004, 0.1479], ["caps.", 0.304, 0.1393, 0.3273, 0.1499], ["Unscrew", 0.2655, 0.1532, 0.306, 0.1638], ["nuts", 0.3095, 0.1545, 0.3298, 0.1638], ["(1).", 0.3333, 0.1525, 0.3495, 0.1651], ["Push", 0.2655, 0.3057, 0.2872, 0.317], ["seat", 0.2908, 0.3077, 0.309, 0.317], ["forward..", 0.3126, 0.3057, 0.3566, 0.317], ["Pull", 0.2655, 0.321, 0.2832, 0.3329], ["off", 0.2867, 0.3183, 0.3004, 0.3375], ["caps.", 0.3034, 0.3183, 0.3288, 0.3375], ["Unscrew", 0.2655, 0.3375, 0.306, 0.3488], [